  "content": "\n\n<hr>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1240026/description_26cd9763-deea-4ac4-8d89-481067a7bbc0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"809\" height=\"578\"></span></strong></em></p>\n<hr>\n<h4><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">本模组包含以下物品：</span></strong></em></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">两种新金属：</span></strong></em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;银和青铜。</span></strong></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">两种新的宝石/水晶：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;红宝石和蓝宝石。</span></strong></em></li>\n<li><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">四种全新的工作台：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;熔炉、伐木机、研磨机和砂光机。</span></strong></em></li>\n<li><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">每个工作台具有以下用途：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;研磨机：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 可将金属研磨成粉末。</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 然后，在工作台中将粉末装入瓶中。</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;伐木机：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 可将原木转化为木柴。</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 然后，你可以将它们放入营火中烧制成燃烧木柴，作为熔炉的燃料。</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 它们也可用作装饰方块。</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;熔炉：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 可熔炼瓶中的金属粉末。</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 然后，利用熔融金属制作硬币。</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;砂光机：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 用于研磨水晶/宝石。</span></strong></em><hr></li>\n</ul>\n<h4><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">本模组还添加了：</span></strong></em></h4>\n<ul>\n<li><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">一种新方块“蛤蜊”：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;破坏它时有小概率掉落珍珠。</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;如果你在128层以上且处于雷雨期间放置蛤蜊方块（可用精准采集获取），闪电会劈中并为其充能。破坏它会给你一个小概率获得充能珍珠的机会。随后，你可以在酿造台中将水瓶与充能珍珠结合，制作出瓶装闪电。</span></strong></em></li>\n<li><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">珍珠强化器：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;你可以使用珍珠强化器来强化珍珠。将强化器放在铁砧上，与珍珠及所需材料（石英、青金石、海晶石、树脂锭或海龟鳞片）一起放置，即可分别获得对应材料的珍珠。</span></strong></em></li>\n<li><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">海洋权杖：</span></strong></em><br><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;使用一瓶闪电、三叉戟和能量导管，你可以制作海洋权杖。这会导致触碰该方块的任何生物被闪电击中。</span></strong></em><hr>\n<h2><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;courier new&#x27;, courier, monospace\">更多内容即将推出……</span></strong></em></h2>\n<hr></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
